      "quote": "The Swiss Transportation Safety Investigation Board (STSB) is the State authority of the Swiss Confederation which has a mandate to investigate accidents and dangerous incidents involving trains, aircraft, inland navigation ships, and seagoing vessels.",
      "gist": "STSB is the Swiss state authority mandated to investigate transport accidents and dangerous incidents across multiple modes."
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "The aim of this activity is to determine not only the direct causes of such events but also the more deep-seated reasons and other risks associated with them.",
      "gist": "The goal is to identify both direct causes and underlying reasons/risk factors for transport incidents."
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "This sole objective of this form of investigation is to acquire insights by means of which future accidents and hazardous situations can be prevented and which result in improved safety.",
      "gist": "The investigation aims to gain insights to prevent future accidents and improve safety."
    }
